      },
      {
        "text": "Great thief ghost hand later steals devour soul Gu from Yang Ku as a soul path Immortal Gu, and Fang Yuan’s time path clone treats it as the core needed to use the killer move devour soul. After the wisdom refinement formation refines it, Fang Yuan takes devour soul Immortal Gu, activates other Gu with it, and draws Yang Ku’s soul out.",
